Regression.1.Tree: egRegTree
Regression.1.trainingOptions: SplitMode=random:!V
Regression.1.Options: MinEvents=300:Shrinkage=0.15:NTrees=1500:MinSignificance=5.0:EventWeight=1.0
Regression.1.DoCombine: False
Regression.1.DoEB: False
Regression.1.VariablesEB: (sc.rawEnergy+sc.rawESEnergy)*regIdealMean:regRealSigma/regIdealMean:ele.trkPModeErr/ele.trkPMode:(sc.rawEnergy+sc.rawESEnergy)*regIdealMean/ele.trkPMode:ele.ecalDrivenSeed:ssFull.e3x3/sc.rawEnergy:ele.fbrem:ele.trkEtaMode:ele.trkPhiMode
Regression.1.VariablesEE: (sc.rawEnergy+sc.rawESEnergy)*regIdealMean:regRealSigma/regIdealMean:ele.trkPModeErr/ele.trkPMode:(sc.rawEnergy+sc.rawESEnergy)*regIdealMean/ele.trkPMode:ele.ecalDrivenSeed:ssFull.e3x3/sc.rawEnergy:ele.fbrem:ele.trkEtaMode:ele.trkPhiMode
